## Pricing
- [Pricing: Free Developer Plan, Pay as You Grow](https://sentry.io/pricing/): Event-based pricing across errors, traces, replays, and logs. Start free on the Developer plan forever, or try Business 

## Signup
- [Start your free trial | Unlimited events 14 days](https://sentry.io/signup/): Debug any software issue, onboard your team, and integrate with your systems. You get 14 days free on our Business plan 

